{
  "name": "PersonaRAG",
  "description": "An evidence-grounded conversational AI that uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation to simulate the publicly documented perspectives of public figures, answering in their voice with inline citations. It includes a Python RAG pipeline (hybrid BM25 + embedding retrieval with ChromaDB), a FastAPI backend, and a React web frontend.",
